      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.83,
      "end_seconds": 11.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.61,
      "end_seconds": 15.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I wanted to get irregular periods looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.86,
      "end_seconds": 17.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.54,
      "end_seconds": 20.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "About... well, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.93,
      "end_seconds": 25.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I follow. Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.08,
      "end_seconds": 34.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "About a eight out of ten. And I've been putting on weight as well, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.16,
      "end_seconds": 53.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.81,
      "end_seconds": 69.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.56,
      "end_seconds": 98.72,
      "duration_seconds": 14.16,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 28.7, height 170 centimetres, blood pressure 127 over 73. And pulse 73, temp 37.0 degrees, weight 83 kilos, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.95,
      "end_seconds": 103.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.44,
      "end_seconds": 107.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.93,
      "end_seconds": 113.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.48,
      "end_seconds": 116.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.18,
      "end_seconds": 141.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "There is some acne on the face and extra hair on the chin, and your blood pressure is fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.18,
      "end_seconds": 150.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.6,
      "end_seconds": 169.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Have you had any pelvic pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.88,
      "end_seconds": 171.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Definitely no pelvic pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.63,
      "end_seconds": 176.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Any breast discharge or hot flushes at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.35,
      "end_seconds": 181.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "No, no breast discharge or hot flushes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.94,
      "end_seconds": 188.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.42,
      "end_seconds": 192.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.3,
      "end_seconds": 195.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.52,
      "end_seconds": 200.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.75,
      "end_seconds": 215.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.36,
      "end_seconds": 226.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I walk the dog every morning. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.32,
      "end_seconds": 230.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.71,
      "end_seconds": 233.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.49,
      "end_seconds": 237.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.04,
      "end_seconds": 245.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.12,
      "end_seconds": 259.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.69,
      "end_seconds": 263.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.29,
      "end_seconds": 279.17,
      "duration_seconds": 13.88,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a pattern that fits polycystic ovary syndrome. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.23,
      "end_seconds": 282.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.93,
      "end_seconds": 299.43,
      "duration_seconds": 15.5,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a pattern that fits polycystic ovary syndrome. Today I'm not changing anything. Okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.41,
      "end_seconds": 302.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.44,
      "end_seconds": 304.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
